<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj retail sales rise 1.5 pct in October.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj retail sales rise 1.5 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Tuesday released the following retail sales data for October.</p>
<p>Revised from figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:</p>
<p>    Oct 1996		  Sept 1996		 Oct 1995</p>
<p>    +1.5 pct		  -0.1 pct (-0.3)	 -0.9 pct</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    Oct 1996		  Sept 1996		 Oct 1995</p>
<p>    +4.9 pct		  +2.4 pct		  +2.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
